    "head_branch": "claude/modest-bohr-ihlpzh",
    "head_commit_message": "feat(tools): a page plays an outcome trace's base and head side by side (spec 37 step 4)\n\ntools/trace_view/ (static HTML and JS, opened from disk): loads a run's base and head\ntraces and trace_diff.py's JSON, and draws both on one scrubber with play, pause and\nstep, each unit a dot with its facing, coloured by its squad's faction, the units the\ndiff names ringed, a clicked unit's fields on both sides. Its logic is trace_view.js,\ntested through Node by test_trace_view_js.py. The digest's trace now writes each squad's\nfaction beside its named fields, unhashed, for the colours.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EjD7H88Dqd82gjeBS3Xmyo",
